%% title: `drain nudges`
%% summary: FIFO advisory-nudge drain for one registered consumer.
%% commentary: This drain path should preserve FIFO ordering and keep the daemon queue generic rather than client-specific.
%% sets: client
flowchart TD
    A[registered-consumer drain request] --> B[Daemon drain handler]
    B --> C1[Locate consumer session]
    C1 -->|not found| E1[ValidationFailed or NotFound]
    C1 --> C2[Drain bounded advisory-nudge queue in FIFO order]
    C2 -->|runtime error| E2[DaemonUnavailable]
    C2 --> O1[Return drained nudges]
